    {
      "id": "2121079437001134415",
      "text": "That one is gonna count. Jets lead 6-3. Kyle Connor has 16 goals on the season. And appropriately Mark Scheifele ties Dale Hawerchuk for most points in Winnipeg Jets history with 929 in his career. https://t.co/9kq96WI1Is",
