    },
    {
      "id": "2121078882157961621",
      "text": "Mark Scheifele ties Dale Hawerchuk for the all-time franchise lead with 929 points. Kyle Connor makes it 6-3. Heck of a shot by the glove of Oettinger. His 16th of the year. Jake Oettinger has been pulled from the game as WPG scores six goals on 27 shots. #NHLJets",
