    {
      "id": "2121076284524540220",
      "text": "Jets with a 5 goal outburst in the middle frame led by Mark Scheifele 2G (chasing Dale Hawerchuk in goals and assists, down by 1 in both categories) and Dawson Mercer 2G. Lots of game left but after the buzzer join the boys on the IC Post-Game Show. https://t.co/hrRpDKh7hR",
