    {
      "id": "2121075783406096648",
      "text": "A healthy Cole Perfetti, the trade add of Dawson Mercer and the callup of Brayden Yager has completely transformed the #NHLJets top 6. And also allowed for Viggo Bjorck to be insulated a bit further down the lineup. Suddenly they aren’t just a one-line team.",
